"This is the part people get wrong. A passphrase does not put a password on your account. It opens a completely different account. Your 12 or 24 words with no passphrase open one account. The same words with the word \"apple\" opens another one. With \"banana\", another one again. Every passphrase is its own separate account, with its own address and its own balance." = "Inilah bagian yang sering salah dipahami. Frasa sandi tidak memasang kata sandi pada akun Anda. Ia membuka akun yang sama sekali berbeda. 12 atau 24 kata Anda tanpa frasa sandi membuka satu akun. Kata yang sama dengan kata \"apple\" membuka akun lain. Dengan \"banana\", akun lain lagi. Setiap frasa sandi adalah akun terpisah, dengan alamat dan saldonya sendiri.";
